Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix mobile scroll on Billing Desk and Day Close pages

Billing Desk: on mobile, use one vertical page scroll so Payment is
reachable; keep split-pane internal scroll only at lg+.

Day Close: add min-w-0 and overflow-x-auto wrappers on wide staff and
closure tables so Counted Cash / Actions columns are not clipped.

Layout: allow horizontal scroll on main instead of clipping overflow-x.
Daily Summary: min-w-0 on page root (same flex shrink fix).
